All Paley DRTs: spectrum = {0} U {+- i sqrt(n)}, tr(S^{2k}) = (-1)^k n^k (n-1).
This is the DRT-defining two-point spectrum => the closed form is DRT-universal.
=> the THM-438 even-cycle (single 2k-cycle) contribution is identical for any DRT,
   no Gauss sum / Weil needed.  Leading-order Catalan skeleton is SPECTRAL (HYP-2308).
